ow dogs remind people to appreciate nature.\n  - workshop about bonding with my pet: Audrey heard about a positive reinforcement training class workshop at her local pet store and met a friendly dog there. Andrew expressed interest.\n  - self-care activity: Audrey does at least one self-care activity daily, like treating herself, while Andrew incorporates coffee breaks and lunch walks for self-care.\n  - coffee: Andrew plans to hang out at a cozy cafe this weekend and might bring his coffee over to a nearby dog park.\n  - house: Audrey recently moved to a new house with a bigger backyard for her dogs. Andrew plans to get more plants for his house.\n</ENTITIES>\n","context_tokens":1994,"context_chars":7947,"retrieval_duration":0.12678790092468262,"response_duration":3.5974960327148438,"total_duration":3.7242839336395264,"grade":true,"grade_reasoning":"The generated answer captures the essence of the gold answer by describing Andrew's work as stressful, even though it elaborates further on the challenges he faces.","completeness_grade":"COMPLETE","completeness_reasoning":"The context provides clear and direct information about Andrew's feelings regarding his work. It explicitly states that Andrew is experiencing tough and stressful work, which aligns perfectly with the golden answer of 'stressful.' Additionally, there are multiple references to the challenges he faces at work, such as difficulty finding peace and balance, which further supports the conclusion about his feelings. Therefore, all necessary information to answer the question is present in the context.","missing_elements":[],"present_elements":["Andrew is experiencing tough and stressful work.","Andrew's job makes it harder for him to find peace.","Andrew finds work tough and stressful."]},{"user_id":null,"graph_id":"v2_full_onto_2_experiment_graph_7","test_id":"v2_full_onto_2_graph_7_qa_138","category":"4","difficulty":"unknown","query":"What made being part of the running group easy for Deborah to stay motivated?","golden_answer":"helping and pushing each other during runs","hypothesis":"Being part of the running group made it easy for Deborah to stay motivated because the group provided support and encouragement. Deborah mentioned that having people who cheer her on and give advice really makes a difference, and she believes that being part of a supportive group is very motivating for her own journey. Additionally, the running group helps push her during runs, reminding her of what is important and bringing her joy.","context":"\nFACTS and ENTITIES represent relevant context to the current conversation.\n\n# These are the most relevant facts for the conversation along with the datetime of the event that the fact refers to.\n# If a fact mentions something happening a week ago, then the datetime will be the date time of last week and not the datetime\n# of when the fact was stated.\n# Timestamps in memories represent the actual time the event occurred, not the time the event was mentioned in a message.\n\n<FACTS>\n  - Deborah receives motivation from the running group because they help and push her during runs. (event_time: 2023-07-09T19:37:00Z)\n  - Deborah believes that being part of a supportive group is very motivating for her own journey. (event_time: 2023-07-09T19:37:00Z)\n  - Deborah mentions that having people who cheer you on and give advice (supportive folks) really makes a difference. (event_time: 2023-07-09T19:37:00Z)\n  - Deborah participates in running with others. (event_time: 2023-07-09T19:37:00Z)\n  - Deborah is participating in the running group she started. (event_time: 2023-07-09T19:37:00Z)\n  - Deb is involved with the running group. (event_time: 2023-07-09T19:37:00Z)\n  - The running group reminds Deborah of what is important (event_time: 2023-07-09T19:37:00Z)\n  - Deborah cares about fitness, which is related to the running group. (event_time: 2023-07-09T19:37:00Z)\n  - Deborah started a running group with Anna. (event_time: 2023-07-09T19:37:0