r the current weekend and will be joined by old friends and teammates from other tournaments.\n  - movie: Joanna is filming her movie based on her road-trip script. She finds every day on set awesome and enjoys showing her vision, with Nate asking about the coolest moment.\n  - cool places: Joanna went hiking and found amazing trails in her town, describing these as cool places where she feels like she could write a whole movie.\n  - Nate: Nate praised Joanna for setting up meetings with movie producers, comparing her success to winning a video game tournament, and expressed pride in her feeling hopeful and inspired.\n  - Nate: Nate congratulated Joanna on filming her movie and showed interest in the coolest moment on set. He also wished her well for her filming experience.\n  - amazing trails: Joanna found more amazing trails while hiking in her town; she described the experience as awesome and now considers herself an expert hiker.\n  - Nate: Nate congratulated Joanna on filming her movie from her road-trip script, asked about the coolest on-set moment, and commented that her food looked yummy with nice colors and kick.\n  - boardgame: Nate met new friends at a game convention who also play a board game Nate loves; they bonded over shared hobbies.\n  - new hair color: Nate dyed their hair last week. Joanna complimented the amazing new shade and was inspired by Nate's boldness to show the world who they are.\n  - Nate: Nate acquired a new family addition named Max and expressed pride in Joanna for staying strong and being true to herself.\n  - hiking: Joanna took a picture while hiking near Fort Wayne last summer; the sunset and nature's beauty were incredible. Existing summary mentions a future hike with friends to a waterfall.\n  - Nate: Nate made homemade coconut ice cream with sprinkles. His game tournament was postponed, and he didn't make the finals. He creates YouTube gaming content. He expressed support for Joanna filming her movie.\n  - Nate: Nate went to 