h of her feelings.","missing_elements":[],"present_elements":["Jolene felt love and gratitude towards 'she' after seeing her under the bed.","The snake was finally found snuggling under the bed."]},{"user_id":null,"graph_id":"v2_full_onto_2_experiment_graph_5","test_id":"v2_full_onto_2_graph_5_qa_31","category":"1","difficulty":"unknown","query":"What has Andrew done with his dogs?","golden_answer":"Taking walks and hiking","hypothesis":"Andrew has hiked with his dogs on October 13, 2023. Additionally, he takes good care of them, as noted on May 3, 2023, and he is currently preparing a space for a new puppy named Scout, which includes a bed, toys, and puppy pads for a slow introduction to his other dogs, Toby and Buddy.","context":"\nFACTS and ENTITIES represent relevant context to the current conversation.\n\n# These are the most relevant facts for the conversation along with the datetime of the event that the fact refers to.\n# If a fact mentions something happening a week ago, then the datetime will be the date time of last week and not the datetime\n# of when the fact was stated.\n# Timestamps in memories represent the actual time the event occurred, not the time the event was mentioned in a message.\n\n<FACTS>\n  - Andrew takes good care of his dogs. (event_time: 2023-05-03T17:41:00Z)\n  - Andrew has hiked with his dogs. (event_time: 2023-10-13T16:22:00Z)\n  - Andrew currently has two dogs which is a lot to take care of (event_time: 2023-11-04T19:59:00Z)\n  - Andrew has dogs that they need to take to the groomer. (event_time: 2023-11-22T09:02:00Z)\n  - Andrew's dogs look content (event_time: 2023-06-13T17:23:00Z)\n  - Andrew has furry friends that he might take to the groomers (event_time: 2023-11-22T09:02:00Z)\n  - Audrey asks Andrew if he has taken his furry friends to the groomers yet (event_time: 2023-11-22T09:02:00Z)\n  - Andrew intends to try those activities with his pups. (event_time: 2023-11-04T19:59:00Z)\n  - Andrew intends to try those activities wit