nt_time: 2023-03-27T13:10:00Z)\n</FACTS>\n\n# These are the most relevant entities\n# ENTITY_NAME: entity summary\n<ENTITIES>\n  - dogs: Audrey took her dogs to the pet salon; they looked cute, groomed, and had shiny coats. Andrew has two dogs, Toby and Buddy. They are considered family members.\n  - doggo: Audrey groomed her dogs, who looked cute with shiny coats after being good at the salon. Andrew adopted another dog and shared a photo.\n  - park: Andrew has a picture of Audrey's dog at a park. Andrew's dogs previously liked sunny days at a park, and Andrew plans to take Scout, Toby, and Buddy to a park.\n  - Andrew: Andrew reacted positively to Audrey's groomed pets and is preparing a space for Scout, including a bed, toys, and puppy pads, for a slow introduction to Toby and Buddy.\n  - pet shelter: Andrew recently adopted another dog from a shelter. Previously, Andrew and his girlfriend volunteered at a pet shelter on Monday, which Andrew found rewarding.\n  - pets: Audrey bought dog toys last Monday. Andrew recently adopted a new puppy who is adjusting to his new home and getting along with Toby. Both find joy in pets.\n  - puppies and dogs: Audrey has four doggies that she takes care of to keep them happy and healthy. Andrew mentioned he would not want puppies and dogs to be punished.\n  - picture: Andrew shared a picture of his dog looking happy while hiking, in response to Audrey mentioning getting tips from an animal behaviorist for her dogs.\n  - trails: Andrew plans to take both his pets to the trails soon. Audrey previously bought dog toys for her dogs.\n  - animals: Andrew acknowledged the peaceful and joyful nature of animals, referencing potential adventures for Audrey's furry buddies.\n  - puppy: Andrew adopted a new puppy named Toby. Andrew shared photos of his puppy playing in the park, which made Andrew and Audrey happy.\n  - new collars and tags: Audrey has cute new collars and tags for her dogs. Andrew found them cute and asked to see a pictur