ing in a weighted blanket for watching movies on a comfy couch.\n  - director: Joanna hopes a director falls in love with her screenplay to get it on the big screen.\n  - romance: Joanna's first full screenplay, finished last Friday, is a mix of drama and romance.\n  - favorite memories: Nate plans to start writing down some of his favorite memories with Joanna.\n  - chocolate raspberry tart: Joanna's favorite dairy-free treat is a chocolate raspberry tart with an almond flour crust, chocolate ganache, and fresh raspberries.\n  - Real-life stories: Nate mentioned that real-life stories are the best for inspiration and looks forward to hearing about Joanna's next one.\n  - things to watch: Nate told Joanna he will give her a shout whenever he runs out of things to watch.\n  - screenplay: Joanna wrote parts of a screenplay that appeared on the big screen yesterday and submitted a recent screenplay to a film contest.\n  - movie script: Joanna is filming a movie based on her road-trip script. She previously hoped for big-screen distribution, and Nate asked about future script submissions.\n  - favorite game: Joanna asked Nate what his favorite game is after he won a Valorant tournament.\n  - chocolate: Joanna's favorite recipe includes chocolate, almond flour, coconut oil, and raspberries, often made for birthdays and special days.\n  - special days: Joanna's favorite recipe, made with almond flour, coconut oil, chocolate, and raspberries, is used for birthdays and special days.\n  - passion: Joanna's writing is a huge part of her; Nate turned his passion for gaming into a career by winning an international tournament.\n</ENTITIES>\n","context_tokens":1926,"context_chars":7521,"retrieval_duration":0.16490435600280762,"response_duration":3.5561490058898926,"total_duration":3.7210533618927,"grade":false,"grade_reasoning":"The generated answer does not mention 'Eternal Sunshine of the Spotless Mind' and instead suggests a different movie, which does not align with the gold