urrent conversation.\n\n# These are the most relevant facts for the conversation along with the datetime of the event that the fact refers to.\n# If a fact mentions something happening a week ago, then the datetime will be the date time of last week and not the datetime\n# of when the fact was stated.\n# Timestamps in memories represent the actual time the event occurred, not the time the event was mentioned in a message.\n\n<FACTS>\n  - Evan acaba de regresar de un viaje con su familia. (event_time: 2023-05-18T13:47:00Z)\n  - Evan took a road trip with his family to Jasper (event_time: 2023-05-20T00:00:00Z)\n  - Evan took a road trip last month. (event_time: 2023-07-27T00:00:00Z)\n  - Evan had adventures with his family last year. (event_time: 2022-01-01T00:00:00Z)\n  - Evan and his family went on a trip to the Rockies. (event_time: 2023-05-18T13:47:00Z)\n  - Evan took a road trip to Jasper (event_time: 2023-05-20T00:00:00Z)\n  - Evan hiked with his family last week. (event_time: 2023-05-11T00:00:00Z)\n  - Evan has memories of road tripping in his car (event_time: 2023-08-19T18:17:00Z)\n  - Family is always there for Evan. (event_time: 2024-01-06T13:32:00Z)\n  - Evan looks forward to building more memories with his family. (event_time: 2023-12-09T13:45:00Z)\n  - Evan went on a trip to Canada last week. (event_time: 2023-07-31T00:00:00Z)\n  - Evan is having a family get-together tonight. (event_time: 2024-01-06T00:00:00Z)\n  - Evan is part of Evan's family. (event_time: 2023-12-09T13:45:00Z)\n  - Evan, as a dad, is the parent of his son. (event_time: 2023-08-15T16:20:00Z)\n  - Evan observed gorgeous lakes during the road trip (event_time: 2023-05-20T00:00:00Z)\n  - Evan observed gorgeous glaciers during the road trip (event_time: 2023-05-20T00:00:00Z)\n  - Evan took a vacation a few years ago. (event_time: 2023-10-06T20:57:00Z)\n  - Evan considers family to be everything. (event_time: 2024-01-06T13:32:00Z)\n  - Evan is looking forward to expanding Evan's family. (ev