ent relevant context to the current conversation.\n\n# These are the most relevant facts for the conversation along with the datetime of the event that the fact refers to.\n# If a fact mentions something happening a week ago, then the datetime will be the date time of last week and not the datetime\n# of when the fact was stated.\n# Timestamps in memories represent the actual time the event occurred, not the time the event was mentioned in a message.\n\n<FACTS>\n  - Caroline suggests researching adoption agencies for the adoption process. (event_time: 2023-10-13T10:31:00Z)\n  - Caroline sought advice regarding adoption. (event_time: 2023-10-13T10:31:00Z)\n  - Melanie is asking Caroline for advice on starting the adoption process. (event_time: 2023-10-13T10:31:00Z)\n  - Caroline is eager to begin the process of adoption. (event_time: 2023-10-13T10:31:00Z)\n  - Caroline suggests researching a lawyer for the adoption process. (event_time: 2023-10-13T10:31:00Z)\n  - Caroline contacted her mentor for adoption advice. (event_time: 2023-10-13T10:31:00Z)\n  - Caroline needs to gather documents for the adoption process. (event_time: 2023-10-13T10:31:00Z)\n  - Caroline is sharing her adoption journey and helping others with theirs, which she considers a gift. (event_time: 2023-10-22T09:55:00Z)\n  - Caroline intends to provide a safe, loving home for kids through adoption. (event_time: 2023-10-13T10:31:00Z)\n  - Caroline attended an adoption advice/assistance group. (event_time: 2023-08-23T00:00:00Z)\n  - Adoption agencies will help Caroline with the process and provide information. (event_time: 2023-10-13T10:31:00Z)\n  - Melanie asks Caroline if she is excited about anything regarding the adoption process. (event_time: 2023-05-25T13:14:00Z)\n  - Caroline is asking Melanie if she has experience or knowledge about adoption. (event_time: 2023-10-13T10:31:00Z)\n  - Caroline has a dream to adopt and provide a loving home. (event_time: 2023-10-13T10:31:00Z)\n  - Caroline is ready to give all her love to a child through adoption. (event_time: 2023-08-23T15:31:00Z)\n  - Caroline offered to help Melanie with adoption if Melanie decides to pursue it (event_time: 2023-10-13T10:31:00Z)\n  - Caroline describes 'It' (presumably the adoption journey mentioned previously) as an ongoing adventure of learning and growing. (event_time: 2023-10-13T10:31:00Z)\n  - Caroline wants to give a loving home to kids who need it. (event_time: 2023-05-25T13:14:00Z)\n  - Melanie wishes Caroline the best on her adoption journey. (event_time: 2023-08-23T15:31:00Z)\n  - Caroline views adoption as a way of giving back and showing love and acceptance. (event_time: 2023-10-22T09:55:00Z)\n  - Caroline intends to give a home to needy kids (event_time: 2023-10-22T09:55:00Z)\n  - Caroline is currently researching adoption agencies. (event_time: 2023-05-25T13:14:00Z)\n  - Caroline is thrilled to make a family for kids who need one. (event_time: 2023-05-25T13:14:00Z)\n  - Caroline hopes to put a roof over children who have not had a family before. (event_time: 2023-10-22T09:55:00Z)\n  - Caroline passed the adoption agency interviews. (event_time: 2023-10-20T00:00:00Z)\n  - Caroline has a goal of having a family. (event_time: 2023-10-22T09:55:00Z)\n  - Caroline thinks the adoption process that Melanie's friend went through is tough but worthwhile (event_time: 2023-10-13T10:31:00Z)\n  - Caroline views adoption as a good way to expand one's family (event_time: 2023-10-13T10:31:00Z)\n  - Caroline applied to adoption agencies this week. (event_time: 2023-08-23T00:00:00Z)\n  - Caroline attended a council meeting for adoption last Friday (event_time: 2023-07-14T00:00:00Z)\n</FACTS>\n\n# These are the most relevant entities\n# ENTITY_NAME: entity summary\n<ENTITIES>\n  - adoption agencies: Caroline is preparing to adopt, seeking advice on finding adoption agencies or lawyers, gathering documents, and preparing emotionally for the process.\n  - adoption advice/assistance group: Caroline a