ews and offered support. Sam's doctor stated their weight is a serious health risk, prompting plans to eat healthier despite sugary cravings.\n  - Sam: Sam is sticking with a difficult change aimed at living healthier, as discussed with Evan. Sam previously made a yummy grilled dish and is taking a cooking class.\n  - Sam: Sam is dealing with discomfort that limits movement and is attempting dietary changes. Sam also became a Weight Watchers coach for better health.\n  - Sam: Sam is dealing with discomfort that limits movement and is trying to make dietary changes. Sam recently obtained a 'feel good' movie that has become a go-to.\n  - Sam: Sam is dealing with rough health issues, feeling weighed down but trying to stay positive. Sam discussed health and rose bush news with Evan.\n  - Sam: Sam organized an epic hiking trip last Friday and commented on food looking healthy, suitable for post-hike or accident recovery.\n  - Sam: Sam is dealing with health issues, feeling weighed down, and trying to stay positive. Sam thanked Evan for their support.\n  - Sam: Sam congratulated Evan, enjoys running in the mornings to clear their head, and is dealing with movement-limiting discomfort while trying dietary changes.\n  - Sam: Sam is dealing with discomfort limiting movement and is trying to make dietary changes. Sam also commented on a spot looking gorgeous, suggesting a peaceful, stunning childhood location.\n  - Sam: Sam is dealing with discomfort limiting movement and is attempting dietary changes. Sam previously expressed excitement about being a coach and plans to hike with Evan.\n  - Sam: Sam is trying to keep up with a new health routine despite feeling pressured, and is planning a hike with Evan.\n  - eating right: Evan stressed that eating right is just as important as exercising for health changes, in a discussion with Sam.\n  - Sam: Sam greeted Evan, mentioned starting to eat healthier, and expressed sympathy regarding Evan's knee injury, asking about ways to sta