levant information, it is not complete enough to definitively answer the question.","missing_elements":["Explicit confirmation that Sam started working out at the gym on July 28, 2023"],"present_elements":["Sam planned to start exercising regularly starting July 28, 2023","Sam planned to start going to the gym on July 28, 2023"]},{"user_id":null,"graph_id":"v2_full_onto_2_experiment_graph_7","test_id":"v2_full_onto_2_graph_7_qa_86","category":"1","difficulty":"unknown","query":"What gifts has Deborah received?","golden_answer":"an appreciate letter from her community, a flower bouqet from her friend, a motivational quote from a friend","hypothesis":"Deborah has received the following gifts:\n\n1. Pineapple birthday cakes from another person when she was a kid.\n2. A bouquet from a friend when she was struggling, which now gives her hope, courage, warmth, and appreciation.\n3. An amulet that belonged to her, which she brings with her whenever she visits places to feel the love of someone and stay close to her.\n\nThese gifts reflect significant memories and emotions for Deborah.","context":"\nFACTS and ENTITIES represent relevant context to the current conversation.\n\n# These are the most relevant facts for the conversation along with the datetime of the event that the fact refers to.\n# If a fact mentions something happening a week ago, then the datetime will be the date time of last week and not the datetime\n# of when the fact was stated.\n# Timestamps in memories represent the actual time the event occurred, not the time the event was mentioned in a message.\n\n<FACTS>\n  - Deborah received pineapple birthday cakes from another person when she was a kid. (event_time: None)\n  - Deborah has an amulet that belonged to her. (event_time: 2023-02-04T09:48:00Z)\n  - Deborah remembers an amulet belonging to her, which she brings with her whenever she visits. (event_time: 2023-02-04T09:48:00Z)\n  - Bali gave Deborah peace. (event_time: 2022-01-01T00:00:00Z)\n  - Deborah