side finding ways to supply clean water to those with limited access.\n  - projects: Jolene is interested in projects that make a real difference, specifically sustainable initiatives and innovative environmental solutions, integrating values from loved ones.\n  - project: Deborah started a community cleanup project for fundraising. Jolene had a setback with her own project, losing all work, and Deborah supports her ambition.\n  - Walking Dead: Jolene and others are planning to play \"Walking Dead\" next Saturday.\n  - engineer: Jolene, an engineer, is coping with an emotional rollercoaster but achieved a major milestone last week, causing relief and pride. She later asked Deborah for an explanation.\n  - success: Jolene is working toward success in her field by studying, attending workshops, and networking, having recently received positive feedback after presenting at a virtual conference.\n  - Jolene: Jolene attended an awesome yoga retreat where she enjoyed a peaceful setting and an amazing sunrise view. She values catching up with friends like Deborah.\n  - Avalanche: Jolene read \"Avalanche\" by Neal Stephenson in one sitting two weeks ago.\n  - career aspirations: Deborah asked Jolene about her career aspirations after Jolene shared a major engineering accomplishment last week.\n  - Battlefield 1: Jolene received the new console game Battlefield 1 last week and mentioned it to Deborah.\n  - setback with Jolene's project: Jolene experienced a huge setback with her project last week, causing her to lose all her work, which was frustrating and depressing. Deborah offered support.\n  - joy on the way: Jolene agreed to Deborah's advice to find joy on the way.\n  - someone close to Jolene: Someone close to Jolene used to bake cookies with her.\n  - quotes: Deborah asked Jolene what other quotes give her strength.\n  - people who love what they do: Jolene is inspired by people who love what they do, seeing them as proof that dedication and effort can achieve anything.\n  - Jolene and her partner: Jolene and her partner went scuba diving last Friday and found a cool spot to explore. Jolene also shared a picture of herself and her partner at a music festival last year.\n  - partner de Jolene: Jolene and her partner planned to play console games together.\n  - achievements: Jolene is making strides toward her goals, finding it tough but satisfying. Deborah expressed pride in Jolene's achievements and offered help.\n  - Jolene and Anna: Deborah mentioned Anna got her a tasty vegan stir-fry (tofu, veg, ginger, soy sauce). Jolene mentioned doing yoga and meditation last Friday for me-time.\n</ENTITIES>\n","context_tokens":1997,"context_chars":8126,"retrieval_duration":0.2445056438446045,"response_duration":4.424681901931763,"total_duration":4.669187545776367,"grade":true,"grade_reasoning":"The generated answer mentions that Jolene was working on a robotics project, which matches the gold answer.","completeness_grade":"COMPLETE","completeness_reasoning":"The context provides multiple facts that clearly indicate that Jolene was working on a large robotics project as of February 1, 2023. The relevant facts explicitly mention that her engineering professor assigned her a robotics project on that date, and additional details describe the nature of the project, confirming it is indeed a robotics project. Therefore, all necessary information to answer the question is present.","missing_elements":[],"present_elements":["Jolene is busy with a large robotics project assigned by her engineering professor (event_time: 2023-02-01T19:03:00Z)","Jolene is working on a tough but fun robotics project that requires creativity and problem-solving (event_time: 2023-02-01T19:03:00Z)","Jolene is currently enjoying working on the robotics project (event_time: 2023-02-01T19:03:00Z)","The robotics project is testing Jolene's creative skills (event_time: 2023-02-01T19:03:00Z)","The robotics project requires Jolene to solve puzzles related to design and progra