t entities\n# ENTITY_NAME: entity summary\n<ENTITIES>\n  - music scene: Calvin toured with Frank Ocean, finding the Tokyo crowd insane. He is excited about the music scene and Dave will cheer him on in Boston.\n  - the tour: Calvin is touring with Frank Ocean, finding the performance energizing with great crowd connection. He acknowledges fame presents challenges in balancing his job and personal life.\n  - serenity: Calvin is excited to experience serenity and looks forward to walking in parks to recharge, following Dave's suggestion about peaceful parks in Boston.\n  - new place: Calvin is exploring his new place, which he describes as a dream come true, after finishing a tour with a well-known artist that ended in Japan.\n  - clips: Calvin loves the Miami vibe for the vid clips and is excited to show them after collaborating with artists to create something unique.\n  - touring: Calvin started touring with Frank Ocean and is enjoying the amazing energy and connection on stage during performances.\n  - performance: Calvin has an upcoming performance in Boston, which Dave is excited about and hopes to attend. Calvin previously performed, describing it as 'insane' and feeling good about his progress.\n  - Frank Ocean: Calvin is on tour with Frank Ocean. Calvin finds the tour awesome but occasionally overwhelming due to many demands, yet pushes on.\n  - joy: Creating something people connect with that brings joy is Calvin's motivation for growth, as felt during his album party celebration.\n  - snowy peak: Calvin plans to see the snowy peak after the tour with Frank Ocean ends.\n  - live music: Dave expressed that live music is the best and wished Calvin well on tour.\n  - spotlight: Dave wished Calvin many more electrifying moments in the spotlight after his tour with Frank Ocean.\n  - Japanese artists: Calvin is working on music collaborations with Japanese artists and is excited about the outcome.\n  - flight ticket: Calvin booked a flight ticket to Boston last we